RESULTS

Hemoglobin A1c is elevated.

ASSESSMENT AND PLAN

Beverly Johnson is a 24-year-old female with a history of type 2 diabetes and hypertension. She presents for her yearly exam.

Type 2 diabetes. Her hemoglobin A1c is elevated. Her blood sugars have been elevated due to diet. She is currently on metformin 1000 mg twice a day. We will continue her on this medication. I encourage her to cut down on snacking and additional sweets. I would like her to check her blood sugars in the morning and call them in in 2 weeks. We will follow up in 2 months to see if her blood sugars are under better control.
