At this point, I have discussed the diagnosis with the patient. I have recommended that we treat her with Motrin, 800 mg, 3 times a day, with food. I have recommended that she use ice and heat alternating. I have recommended that she walk. She is to follow up in one week if her symptoms do not improve or worsen.

